                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>选中公告栏或服务台后，从"对象 Skill"的 Skill 选项中绑定。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 500, height: 150, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
